#: docs/app/content/guide/releases/upgrade-to-v5.mdx
msgid ""
"Ardo 5 uses Ferromark for Markdown and MDX, including native Ferriki syntax "
"highlighting. Ferromark emits framework-neutral JSX; Ardo supplies React "
"component bindings, layouts, page context, and route metadata. Your existing "
"React route setup remains the integration point."
