"After <1/> has written every page, Ardo verifies each internal link, image, "
"script, stylesheet, <2/> candidate, and meta refresh in the generated HTML, "
"whether it came from Markdown, a component, or a generated page. It also "
"checks the redirect destinations in <3/> and <4/> and the version paths in "
"<5/>. Unless disabled, it verifies that every <6/> matches an element id on "
"the target page. Redirect sources are valid targets, because Ardo writes a "
"page for each of them."
msgstr ""
