#: docs/app/content/guide/agent-instructions.mdx
msgid ""
"Extend <0/> in <1/>; it sets <2/> and Ardo's type declarations. TypeScript is "
"a development tool: the Basic example only depends on Ardo at runtime. Any "
"TypeScript 6 or newer typechecks a site; keep the project's version. Native "
"API documentation needs the pinned TypeScript 7.1 nightly from <3>API "
"Documentation</3>, which the Basic example already uses."
msgstr ""
